ndary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170912012821&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Treasure_Map_b4eaea.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a treasure map.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 8.30 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It obviously shows Treasure Island including a big, red cross and detailed instructions.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Not a real map.<br/>\nIt gives random coordinates such as:<br/>\n6 steps north and 9 steps east<br/>\nTry digging here!<br/>\n2 steps north 1 step west<br/>\n1 step south 9 steps east<br/>\nTry digging here!\n</p><p><br/>This happens in any place you <i>use it</i>.<br/>\nIt looks the same as the <a href=\"#/wiki/Treasure%20Map%20%28Pirate%29\">Treasure Map (Pirate)</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pirate%20Treasure%20Map\">Pirate Treasure Map</a>, and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Plan\">Plan</a>.\n</p><p>Use it 100 times to get the achievement Slim Chance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Memory%20of%20a%20Pirate\">Memory of a Pirate</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 cla